{
  "name": "FB · Regeneration Webhook (WF3)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "fb-regenerate",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [0, 240],
      "id": "wf3-webhook-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook (fb-regenerate)",
      "webhookId": "fb-regenerate"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [ { "id": "secret", "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers.authorization }}", "rightValue": "=Bearer __N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET__", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } } ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 240],
      "id": "wf3-verify-0000000000002",
      "name": "Verify Secret"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=__SUPABASE_URL__/rest/v1/fb_posts?id=eq.{{ $json.body.post_id }}&select=*",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" }
        ] },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [460, 200],
      "id": "wf3-get-post-00000000003",
      "name": "Get Post"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [ { "id": "manual", "leftValue": "={{ $json.needs_manual }}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true } } ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 200],
      "id": "wf3-needs-manual-0000004",
      "name": "needs_manual?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groupme.com/v3/bots/post",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ bot_id: '__GROUPME_BOT_ID__', text: '⚠️ Regen cap hit — write the post for ' + $json.scheduled_date + ' by hand in the Dashboard.' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [900, 80],
      "id": "wf3-alert-000000000005",
      "name": "GroupMe: Manual Needed"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "x-api-key", "value": "__ANTHROPIC_API_KEY__" },
          { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
          { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: '__ANTHROPIC_MODEL__', max_tokens: 1200, messages: [ { role: 'user', content: 'Regenerate the ' + $('Webhook (fb-regenerate)').item.json.body.component + '. rejection_feedback: ' + $('Webhook (fb-regenerate)').item.json.body.reason_code + ': ' + ($('Webhook (fb-regenerate)').item.json.body.reason_text || '') + '. If only copy was rejected and the image is approved, keep the existing image_concept.' } ] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [900, 240],
      "id": "wf3-regen-00000000006",
      "name": "Anthropic: Regenerate"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=__SUPABASE_URL__/rest/v1/fb_posts?id=eq.{{ $('Webhook (fb-regenerate)').item.json.body.post_id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [
          { "name": "apikey", "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY" },
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
        ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify( $('Webhook (fb-regenerate)').item.json.body.component === 'image' ? { image_status: 'pending' } : { copy_status: 'pending' } ) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1120, 240],
      "id": "wf3-update-00000000007",
      "name": "Update Post (component → pending)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "respondWith": "json", "responseBody": "={{ $json }}", "options": {} },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1340, 240],
      "id": "wf3-respond-00000000008",
      "name": "Respond"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ CONTRACT: WF3 ↔ Dashboard action (SYSTEM OF RECORD)\n\nThe Reece Dashboard is the system of record. `lib/actions/content.ts → rejectComponent()` is the authoritative writer of a rejection. BEFORE this webhook fires, that action has ALREADY:\n  1. inserted the `fb_post_feedback` row (snapshotting the rejected copy/image),\n  2. flipped the rejected component to `status = 'rejected'`,\n  3. incremented `fb_posts.revision`, and\n  4. set `needs_manual = true` once `revision >= MAX_REGEN_ATTEMPTS`.\n\nTHIS workflow CONSUMES that — it must **NOT** insert feedback again. It reads the\nlatest feedback for the post/component, regenerates copy and/or image (reusing the\nkept image when only copy was rejected), and sets the regenerated component back to\n`pending`. If `needs_manual` is already set, it alerts on GroupMe and stops.\n\nPayload: { post_id, component, reason_code, reason_text, rejected_by }.\nThe mirror of this note lives in lib/actions/content.ts (rejectComponent).",
        "height": 360, "width": 520
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -380],
      "id": "wf3-note-000000000009",
      "name": "CONTRACT — read me"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Webhook (fb-regenerate)": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Verify Secret", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Verify Secret": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Get Post", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ], [ { "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Get Post": { "main": [ [ { "node": "needs_manual?", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "needs_manual?": { "main": [ [ { "node": "GroupMe: Manual Needed", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ], [ { "node": "Anthropic: Regenerate", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "GroupMe: Manual Needed": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Anthropic: Regenerate": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Update Post (component → pending)", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Update Post (component → pending)": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1", "timezone": "America/New_York" },
  "meta": { "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false },
  "tags": [ { "id": "fb-content-engine", "name": "FB Content Engine" } ]
}
